                            <div class="s_allow_columns container">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in col-lg-12 pb8">
                                        <h2>WE STARTED <span class="bg-o-color-3">IN 2018</span></h2>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-6 o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_colored_level">
                                        <p>When a group of five students realised that university had so much potential — but almost nothing helping them unlock it. No space to experiment. No community to lean on. No structure to turn a spark into something real.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-6 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in pt0">
                                        <p>So they built it themselves. A single weekly meetup turned into workshops, panels, projects, and partnerships. Today we run across 12 campuses, serve 400+ active members, and have launched dozens of ventures, publications, and campaigns that actually matter.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <section class="s_text_block pt40 pb40 o_colored_level o_cc o_cc5 s_custom_snippet" data-snippet="s_text_block" data-name="Custom Text (2)">
